    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One message, two readers: the owner of the restaurant and the\n// operator (docs/23_ACCESS_SECURITY.md, T12). The channel node sends\n// one push per item and fails the run if either fails.\nconst { title, text, priority } = $input.first().json;\nreturn ['owner', 'ops'].map((topic) => ({\n  json: { topic, title, text, priority },\n}));\n"
      },
      "id": "72680f16-d25c-5234-98c1-f9a20f589adc",
      "name": "To owner and ops",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1160,
        1200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://push/",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ topic: $json.topic, title: $json.title, message: $json.text, priority: $json.priority === 'high' ? 4 : 3 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 5000
        }
      },
      "id": "9d9cc0ff-0892-50cb-9300-dddb56db352b",
      "name": "Send push to owner and ops",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1400,
        1200
      ],
      "notes": "Publishes each item to its topic, owner or ops. Fails when sending fails.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Team channel\n\n**Send push to team** publishes `title`, `text` and `priority` to the topic `team` on the push server of the Compose stack (`http://push/`).\n\nIt needs a \"Header Auth\" credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer <token of the user n8n>`. The credential lives in n8n, never in the repo.\n\nThe node must fail when sending fails: no \"Continue on Fail\".\n\nDetails: `n8n/README.md`\n",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b7953e21-0744-5c0d-bb2c-66ab064c6716",
      "name": "Note: team channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Owner and ops channel\n\nA staff change and a change of the call mode go to the owner and to the operator (T12). **To owner and ops** turns the message into two items, and **Send push to owner and ops** publishes each to its topic, `owner` or `ops`, with the same credential as the team channel.\n\nNo \"Continue on Fail\": a failed push sends the event again, so the owner may get one twice.\n\nDetails: `n8n/README.md`\n",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "7b183d09-6b6a-52e8-b3a8-4499538bb3f6",
      "name": "Note: owner and ops channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        1460
      ]
    }
  ],
